[fs] /data is FAT: no writable shared mapping (a MAP_SHARED of an O_RDWR file is ENODEV: fat has no pager that writes pages back, docs/WRITEMAP-PLAN.md section 3). Pass on ext since WE1/WE2/WL1 (WT1 measured them on ext, 2026-10-18); not measured on FAT
